    "실질임금 = 명목임금 ÷ 소비자물가지수 × 100. 인상률이 그해 물가상승률보다 낮으면 실질임금은 마이너스예요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to calculate the real wage.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reálná mzda = nominální mzda ÷ index spotřebitelských cen × 100. Pokud je zvýšení nižší než inflace daného roku, reálná mzda klesá."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reel løn = nominel løn ÷ forbrugerprisindeks × 100. Er din stigning lavere end årets inflation, falder din reelle løn."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reallohn = Nominallohn ÷ Verbraucherpreisindex × 100. Liegt deine Erhöhung unter der Inflation des Jahres, sinkt dein Reallohn."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Πραγματικός μισθός = ονομαστικός μισθός ÷ δείκτης τιμών καταναλωτή × 100. Αν η αύξησή σας είναι χαμηλότερη από τον πληθωρισμό του έτους, ο πραγματικός μισθός πέφτει."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Real wage = nominal wage ÷ consumer price index × 100. If your raise is lower than that year's inflation, your real wage goes down."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Real wage = nominal wage ÷ consumer price index × 100. If your raise is lower than that year's inflation, your real wage goes down."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sueldo real = sueldo nominal ÷ índice de precios al consumo × 100. Si tu subida es menor que la inflación de ese año, tu sueldo real baja."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reaalipalkka = nimellispalkka ÷ kuluttajahintaindeksi × 100. Jos korotuksesi on pienempi kuin vuoden inflaatio, reaalipalkka laskee."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salaire réel = salaire nominal ÷ indice des prix à la consommation × 100. Si votre augmentation est inférieure à l’inflation de l’année, votre salaire réel baisse."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gaji riil = gaji nominal ÷ indeks harga konsumen × 100. Jika kenaikan Anda lebih rendah dari inflasi tahun itu, gaji riil turun."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salario reale = salario nominale ÷ indice dei prezzi al consumo × 100. Se l’aumento è inferiore all’inflazione di quell’anno, il salario reale scende."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "実質賃金＝名目賃金÷消費者物価指数×100。昇給率がその年の物価上昇率より低いと、実質賃金はマイナスです。"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reell lønn = nominell lønn ÷ konsumprisindeks × 100. Er økningen din lavere enn årets inflasjon, faller den reelle lønnen."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reëel loon = nominaal loon ÷ consumentenprijsindex × 100. Is je verhoging lager dan de inflatie van dat jaar, dan daalt je reële loon."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wynagrodzenie realne = nominalne ÷ wskaźnik cen konsumpcyjnych × 100. Jeśli podwyżka jest niższa niż inflacja w danym roku, wynagrodzenie realne spada."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salário real = salário nominal ÷ índice de preços ao consumidor × 100. Se o seu aumento for menor que a inflação do ano, o salário real cai."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Реальная зарплата = номинальная ÷ индекс потребительских цен × 100. Если прибавка меньше инфляции за год, реальная зарплата падает."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reallön = nominell lön ÷ konsumentprisindex × 100. Är din höjning lägre än årets inflation sjunker reallönen."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ค่าจ้างจริง = ค่าจ้างตามราคาปัจจุบัน ÷ ดัชนีราคาผู้บริโภค × 100 ถ้าอัตราขึ้นเงินเดือนต่ำกว่าเงินเฟ้อของปีนั้น ค่าจ้างจริงจะติดลบ"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reel ücret = nominal ücret ÷ tüketici fiyat endeksi × 100. Zammınız o yılın enflasyonundan düşükse reel ücret düşer."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lương thực = lương danh nghĩa ÷ chỉ số giá tiêu dùng × 100. Nếu mức tăng lương thấp hơn lạm phát năm đó, lương thực sẽ âm."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实际工资＝名义工资÷消费者物价指数×100。如果涨薪幅度低于当年物价涨幅，实际工资就是负的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "實際工資＝名義工資÷消費者物價指數×100。如果漲薪幅度低於當年物價漲幅，實際工資就是負的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
